ERAA’s core function is to advocate for its members by engaging with Europe’s key regulatory institutions. The association works to enhance regional air connectivity, safeguard the competitiveness of European regional aviation and promote both environmental and social responsibility. It also plays a vital role in advancing safety, operational performance and air traffic management. In addition, ERAA facilitates knowledge sharing and collaboration through a range of events, working groups, meetings and forums.
