Your Mission, Should You Choose to Accept It
Decisions about housing, tourism and city life get made somewhere, and they shape every place we call home. As our Public Affairs Intern, you’ll help us keep an ear to the ground. You’ll scan the news, follow the agendas and debates, and flag what matters to the team before it turns into a surprise. With locations across the Netherlands, Spain, Italy, Portugal, Germany, Austria, France and the UK, you’ll get a front row seat to how a fast-growing hospitality company works with policy and institutions at local, national and European level. You’ll team up with Public Affairs and with colleagues from Internal Communications, Brand, Operations and our city and property teams, and you’ll get stuck into campaigns, events and position papers along the way. If you love turning a pile of policy documents into one clear, sharp summary, this is your playground. Come and say Hi.
